{"version":1,"key":"card:654","content":{"id":654,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"083a6294-9747-4ba5-9fcc-ac641beb49ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requestSubmit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都是用来提交表单的，但是在行为上有所不同："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"c9c27cd4-0896-4bf3-a0ac-a20110e90886","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"92245e92-972c-48c2-9941-24bac5029590","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c00e52b6-40a2-4fe9-833a-e76222565dbc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会直接发送 HTTP 请求提交表单数据，绕过原生的 HTML 校验，也不会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，因此如果通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"addEventListener()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 监听 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件是不会执行的"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9868904-e568-421e-bfd5-743e52c97e97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一般用于需要自行校验数据的场景"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"c6ffdbfe-a6ab-4b85-b246-55767d8f1283","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8dba9762-4a70-4a82-8bc1-fc032d0efcb0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const form = document.getElementById('myForm');\nconst submitBtn = document.getElementById('submitBtn');\n\nsubmitBtn.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n\n  // 获取表单数据\n  const username = document.getElementById('username').value;\n  const email = document.getElementById('email').value;\n  const age = document.getElementById('age').value;\n\n  // 自定义验证逻辑\n  const errors = [];\n\n  if (username.length < 3) {\n    errors.push('用户名至少需要 3 个字符');\n  }\n\n  if (!email.includes('@')) {\n    errors.push('邮箱格式不正确');\n  }\n\n  if (age < 18) {\n    errors.push('必须年满 18 岁');\n  }\n\n  // 如果有错误，显示并返回\n  if (errors.length > 0) {\n    toast.error('验证失败：\\n' + errors.join('\\n'));\n    return;\n  }\n\n  // 验证通过，直接提交表单到服务器\n  // 注意：这会导致页面刷新/跳转\n  form.submit();\n});","collabId":"816b258c-737f-4c41-8fa8-64f1840d2fd5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7bc8e75d-55bc-41ec-8287-abafa4937c31","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"df9eb1d3-8f69-426d-8f61-6987e1a7ab86","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requestSubmit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相当于模拟用户点击提交，会触发原生的 HTML 校验，只有当校验通过之后才会提交表单，也会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，并且可以被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"preventDefault()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 阻止提交"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"26c0cbdb-6df4-483c-940a-5e8167c6b6c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requestSubmit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还可以指定 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submitter"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果没有指定，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submitter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"form"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 本身"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"9e4faf97-68e5-43ec-8c19-0001915d85b4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"585e81f3-b43e-40bc-9671-ab3c8707e6e6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"form.requestSubmit()\nform.requestSubmit(submitter)","collabId":"c9fb84eb-d3ec-4e41-9c6c-79df10e393c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1faf8d5e-8ba5-4b96-ac71-cc317abfcee8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常用于需要使用原生的 HTML5 校验，或者在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件中阻止默认表单提交行为（表单提交会导致页面刷新），自行通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ajax"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fetch"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行提交表单数据自行处理提交结果"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"45fa3ef5-16c0-41ce-aba1-b9057322a210","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ac075e3c-8661-4e76-99de-5bbf3dd18fb5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n  // 阻止默认的表单提交行为（防止页面刷新）\n  e.preventDefault();\n\n  const formData = new FormData(form);\n  const data = Object.fromEntries(formData.entries());\n\n  // 自定义校验逻辑\n  if (data.username === 'admin') {\n    toast.error('用户名 \"admin\" 已被占用');\n    return;\n  }\n\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch('/api/register', {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify(data)\n    });\n\n    const result = await response.json();\n\n    if (response.ok) {\n      toast.success('注册成功！');\n      form.reset(); // 重置表单\n      // 可以跳转到其他页面\n      // window.location.href = '/dashboard';\n    } else {\n      toast.error('注册失败：' + result.message);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    toast.error('网络错误：' + error.message);\n  }\n});","collabId":"f898f354-0b81-4840-beb3-b76c0da9bd1d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"07a937b4-e449-473d-b1bf-a066bc3259f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submitter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有一些注意事项："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a4636c28-91c2-44aa-873f-023ad12ccd76","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"037afee2-1615-4b8e-9569-56d836693096","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24cb0a5e-55c5-449f-86c7-df09e2717bf8","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submitter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 必须是提交按钮，即 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type=\"submit\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type=\"image\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"的元素（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"button"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素的默认值就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submit"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），否则会抛出 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"TypeError"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的异常"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dad118d0-e877-4b73-a010-ab2f31bf6bfa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提交按钮也必须是表单的成员，否则会抛出 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"NotFoundError"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是说提交按钮要么是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"form"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的子元素，要么使用了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"form"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性引用了表单"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4945fe79-4971-453e-b4dc-df5b81bf6ba4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"21fbdbc6-cc20-4b6a-862f-3499fe9c7afc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通常提交行为（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"action"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）和提交方式（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"method"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）都是写在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"form"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上的，但是如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submitter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中有提供 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"form* "},{"type":"formatted","text":"属性，如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"formaction"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"formmethod"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么就会覆盖原有的提交行为和提交方式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75523f9c-8903-43c4-abf5-7eb670edc8db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一种应用场景：一个表单同时实现「保存草稿」和「正式发布」"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"269cefd2-0d96-49db-af99-2c41a0bea419","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0ec87921-609f-4d51-bfbd-945e1921ec28","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<form action=\"/save-draft\" method=\"GET\">\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"title\" value=\"我的文章\">\n    <button type=\"submit\">保存草稿</button>\n    <button type=\"submit\" \n            formaction=\"/publish\" \n            formmethod=\"POST\">\n        正式发布\n    </button>\n</form>","collabId":"42190bee-8cc3-463a-b673-6edaa868c014","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"034b574b-86c3-4a78-9003-a643402d582b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当点击「保存草稿」时，会发送 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"GET /save-draft?title=\"我的文章\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到服务器，当点击「正式发布」时则会发送 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"POST /publish"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（数据在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"body"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中）到服务器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4a960963-f9d7-4b19-adc5-b2ce62162894","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e86727c-32ad-471b-ba0e-3cd67b8be23c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submitter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 携带了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，那么其 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会一并提交"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"1ef8e139-254b-4bff-b5a3-70f7c6621b07","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2c978fb9-8b10-4b43-a7ee-53a86f9fcaa6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<form action=\"/process-decision\" method=\"POST\">\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"101\">\n\n    <button type=\"submit\" name=\"decision\" value=\"approve\">同意</button>\n    <button type=\"submit\" name=\"decision\" value=\"reject\">拒绝</button>\n</form>","collabId":"cf465e34-686b-46fa-b2ef-81832a159f92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76b6b5f5-ce7e-4645-8bb7-00682efd0044","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当点击「同意」的时候发送的数据是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id=101&decision=approve"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，点击「拒绝」的时候发送的数据就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id=101&decision=reject"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"37f2e62d-e791-45f5-af90-fe4baf7a18a1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83cf47c0-1b1b-4001-b787-ed54beb5784b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type=\"image\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"submitter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提交的数据比较特殊，它携带的是点击的坐标 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"${name}.x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"${name}.y"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"c2d63d6a-3eac-4ed7-9500-55c7d7249eb5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6ece7009-c00e-4cfb-a257-24dd740f09f7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<form action=\"/handle-submit\" method=\"GET\">\n    <!-- 图片提交按钮 -->\n    <input type=\"image\" src=\"save-icon.png\" name=\"picBtn\" />\n</form>","collabId":"e902b852-09c3-4390-a68a-45132a73e45a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"27444ace-c638-4053-9405-ff3e335d2113","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设点击了图片上 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(15, 20)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 坐标的位置，那么携带的数据就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"picBtn.x=15&picBtn.y=20"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，服务端会根据坐标计算出点击的区域，从而有不同的处理逻辑。"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e9fbabc-f22c-40a4-92e3-c6f44d60a1f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"80044af8-00de-447d-b964-977acfc57c04","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b56a3e74-d889-4efb-92b8-241ba11c1e8b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3151479f-d44d-4875-8369-fdc699eeeca7","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLFormElement/requestSubmit","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"5aa74045-d22e-495e-9930-a88b8abaef2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"HTMLFormElement: requestSubmit() method"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1f663cf6-7116-4713-9941-d35d214c91a2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dda5f5d2-1536-4e03-a6b9-8fee88f2a841","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Submit_button","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"58226823-9daa-4d81-a9e1-099de1785fe6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Submit button"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["概念对比","HTML/form","JavaScript/表单"],"createTime":1767178514912,"updateTime":1769086453862,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1769086453862}}